{
  "description": "IB1 runtime-configuration fixtures. valid/* must be accepted with the reference-app build context. Each invalid entry is either a committed file or a declared mutation (RFC 6901 set/remove) of a valid base document; expect gives the first failing stage, the first code and the full issue list [stage, code, path]. Secret-shaped, credential and byte-level cases are generated inside the tests, not committed.",
